  "proofLimits": [
    "The packet and replay tests use offline fake clients only; they make no provider or model call.",
    "The adapters accept caller-supplied client objects and do not inspect provider credentials; this packet proves no credential custody property of those clients.",
    "Requested store or cache fields do not prove provider-side retention, deletion, zero-data-retention status, or policy compliance.",
    "Source digests and replays prove only the named adapter snapshot and cases, not deployment, release contents, whole-SDK security, or future behavior.",
    "Nothing here proves OpenAI or Anthropic participation, review, certification, adoption, affiliation, endorsement, or intent to join KINGDOM OS.",
    "The anthropic adapter sources on this branch are ahead of the pinned commit; the digests above are of the branch bytes, and the new chronicle gate has no replay case in this packet yet."
  ]
